<section class="tab" id="bio">
<div class="card v"><h2>⑤ 대표 동물 · 바다/육지 단면</h2>
<svg viewBox="0 0 600 210"><rect width="600" height="210" fill="#bfe3ff"/><rect x="0" y="80" width="400" height="130" fill="#2a7bd0"/><path d="M400 150Q430 110 470 108L600 108V210H400Z" fill="#8a6a4a"/><path d="M0 80Q200 70 400 80V92H0Z" fill="#fff4"/><text x="150" y="105" style="fill:#fff">바다</text><text x="520" y="98" style="fill:#2a4a1a;font-weight:700">육지</text>
